  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Now let's write the optimal solution.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2260,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 68,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "First, store the array length in n, then set i to n -2.",
      "start_ms": 2860,
      "end_ms": 7780,
      "start_frame": 86,
      "end_frame": 233,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "We move i left.",
      "start_ms": 8380,
      "end_ms": 9480,
      "start_frame": 251,
      "end_frame": 284,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "While i is valid, and nums at i is greater than or equal to nums at i plus 1.",
      "start_ms": 10020,
      "end_ms": 16260,
      "start_frame": 301,
      "end_frame": 488,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "When this loop stops, either we found the pivot, or no pivot exists.",
      "start_ms": 16960,
      "end_ms": 22300,
      "start_frame": 509,
      "end_frame": 669,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "If i is still greater than or equal to 0, we have a valid pivot.",
      "start_ms": 22740,
      "end_ms": 27400,
      "start_frame": 682,
      "end_frame": 822,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Now set j to n minus 1.",
      "start_ms": 27900,
      "end_ms": 30080,
      "start_frame": 837,
      "end_frame": 902,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Move j left, while nums at j is less than or equal to nums at i.",
      "start_ms": 30460,
      "end_ms": 35860,
      "start_frame": 914,
      "end_frame": 1076,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "When that loop stops, j is the first value from the right.",
      "start_ms": 36600,
      "end_ms": 40220,
      "start_frame": 1098,
      "end_frame": 1207,
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "That is strictly greater than the pivot.",
      "start_ms": 40600,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "start_frame": 1218,
      "end_frame": 1279,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Now swap nums at i with nums at j.",
      "start_ms": 43140,
      "end_ms": 46820,
      "start_frame": 1294,
      "end_frame": 1405,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, set left to i plus 1, and right to n minus 1.",
      "start_ms": 46860,
      "end_ms": 52000,
      "start_frame": 1406,
      "end_frame": 1560,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "While left is smaller than right, swap nums at left with nums at right, then move left forward and right backward.",
      "start_ms": 52420,
      "end_ms": 61580,
      "start_frame": 1573,
      "end_frame": 1847,
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "This reverses the suffix in place.",
      "start_ms": 62440,
      "end_ms": 64800,
      "start_frame": 1873,
      "end_frame": 1944,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "If no pivot was found, i becomes minus 1.",
      "start_ms": 65280,
      "end_ms": 69000,
      "start_frame": 1958,
      "end_frame": 2070,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Then the swap block is skipped, and left becomes 0 automatically.",
      "start_ms": 69000,
      "end_ms": 74320,
      "start_frame": 2070,
      "end_frame": 2230,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "So the same reverse loop reverses the whole array.",
      "start_ms": 74960,
      "end_ms": 79220,
      "start_frame": 2249,
      "end_frame": 2377,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "That turns the largest permutation into the smallest permutation.",
      "start_ms": 79940,
      "end_ms": 84540,
      "start_frame": 2398,
      "end_frame": 2536,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "The important part is not memorizing these lines.",
      "start_ms": 85540,
      "end_ms": 88660,
      "start_frame": 2566,
      "end_frame": 2660,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Each line follows the same reasoning.",
      "start_ms": 89280,
      "end_ms": 91720,
      "start_frame": 2678,
      "end_frame": 2752,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Find the rightmost place that can increase.",
      "start_ms": 91720,
      "end_ms": 95180,
      "start_frame": 2752,
      "end_frame": 2855,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the smallest increase.",
      "start_ms": 96120,
      "end_ms": 97940,
      "start_frame": 2884,
      "end_frame": 2938,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Then minimize the suffix.",
      "start_ms": 98620,
      "end_ms": 100480,
      "start_frame": 2959,
      "end_frame": 3014,
      "word_count": 4
    }
  ],
